  "extract": "Henry David Thoreau was an American naturalist, essayist, poet, and philosopher. A leading transcendentalist, he is best known for his book Walden, a reflection upon simple living in natural surroundings, and his essay \"Civil Disobedience\", an argument in favor of citizen disobedience against an unjust state.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Henry David Thoreau</b> was an American naturalist, essayist, poet, and philosopher. A leading transcendentalist, he is best known for his book <i>Walden</i>, a reflection upon simple living in natural surroundings, and his essay \"Civil Disobedience\", an argument in favor of citizen disobedience against an unjust state.</p>"
